HIGH-LEVEL AI GOVERNANCE ARCHITECTURE
(PUBLIC SAFE VERSION)
====================================================================

Purpose
This diagram illustrates a conceptual governance architecture
for AI-driven decision systems. The framework separates predictive
model output from executable system actions through structured
validation and safety layers.

Note:
Detailed algorithms, mathematical models, and safety control
mechanisms are intentionally omitted from this public version.


