--------------------------------------------------------------------
DESIGN PRINCIPLE
--------------------------------------------------------------------

The architecture enforces a separation between:

• predictive intelligence
• governance validation
• safety supervision
• system execution

This separation ensures that AI outputs are not directly
converted into real-world actions without passing through
structured oversight layers.


